{"id":"leetcode-1085","version":1,"status":"approved","title":"Sum of Digits in the Minimum Number","summary":"For an integer array nums, output 0 if the sum of digits in the smallest number within the array is odd, otherwise output 1.","statement":"For an integer array nums, output 0 if the sum of digits in the smallest number within the array is odd, otherwise output 1.","constraints":["nums contains positive integers.","Return whether the digit sum of its minimum value is even."],"topics":["math","arrays"],"prerequisites":[],"signature":{"name":"minimum_digit_sum_is_even","parameters":[{"name":"nums","annotation":"list[int]","adapter":"raw","source_parameter":null}],"returns":"bool","return_adapter":"raw","node_policy":"values","result_mode":"return","mutated_parameter":null,"immutable_parameters":[]},"starter_code":"def minimum_digit_sum_is_even(nums: list[int]) -> bool:\n    # Write your solution here.\n    pass\n","reference_solution":"def minimum_digit_sum_is_even(nums):\n return sum(map(int,str(min(nums))))%2==0\n","brute_force_solution":null,"known_wrong_solutions":["def minimum_digit_sum_is_even(nums):\n return sum(map(int,str(max(nums))))%2==0\n","def minimum_digit_sum_is_even(nums):\n return sum(map(int,str(min(nums))))%2==1\n"],"target_time_complexity":"O(n+digits)","target_space_complexity":"O(digits)","estimated_minutes":20,"rubric":{"algorithmic_insight":1,"prerequisites":1,"implementation":1,"performance_pressure":0,"edge_cases":0},"hints":["Only the smallest array element matters after selection.","Convert that number to decimal digits and sum them.","Return whether the sum modulo two is zero.","This directly implements the two independent selection and parity requirements."],"editorial":"This directly implements the two independent selection and parity requirements.","tests":[{"id":"lc-1085-1","arguments":[[34,23,1,24,75,33,54,8]],"expected":false,"comparator":"exact","visible":true,"explanation":"The minimum is one, whose digit sum is odd.","expe